                    (31, "body", "maculas in oculis nascentes purgat ett discuti[t] :", "cleanses and disperses spots growing in the eyes.", ""),
                    (32, "heading", "De tinctura Corallor[um] An Boetius 157", "Of the Tincture of Corals, Anselmus Boëtius [p.] 157", ""),
                    (33, "body", "Ego certe testari possum me in extremo febris pesti=", "I can certainly testify that I, lying in the extremity of a pestilent", ""),
