                    (40, "body", "cordialia tinctur[ae] sumpsissem cordis spiritus", "cordials of the tincture, the spirits of the heart", ""),
                    (41, "body", "ita recreari, & natiuu[m] praehensum & quippiam", "were so refreshed, and...", ""),
