                    (42, "heading", "E Succino magisteriu[m] sic", "Magistery from Amber thus", ""),
                    (43, "body", "Tunditur minutissime, cui affunditur spiritus", "It is pounded most finely, onto which is poured spirit", ""),
                    (44, "body", "vini ut soluatur, at p[er] mensem digeratur .", "of wine so that it may dissolve, and digested for a month.", ""),
